{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300agod and Scratch Card\u300b is a scratch-off simulation roguelite game. You can use dozens of different God of Wealth and winning symbols to form special scratch cards, and then scratch the winning amount to help you win the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Scratch Card<strong>\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/\u522e\u522e\u5361.png?t=1743425002\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traditional scratch-off game, scratch any non-numerical symbol, you can get the bonus below the symbol</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Symbol\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/image.png?t=1743425002\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each scratch-off, you can choose one of three random symbols to add to your card pool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The symbol has a limit of times, the number of times consumed after each drawing, and the number of times disappears when it is 0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The same symbol is obtained many times, and the number of times is superimposed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Symbols have attributes (such as sports, Chinese characters, zodiac signs, etc.), and different symbols can be linked with different gods of wealth to get higher rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Material\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/image1.png?t=1743425002\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are several ways to add textures \u2191 to symbols in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Silver: Get an extra 1 times the winning amount</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gold: Get twice the winning amount</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diamonds: Forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stone: does not count bonus, every time you scrape out, change to any material</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coal: Bonus is not counted, number of times +5, every time you scrape out, there is a chance to become a diamond material</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glass: Get an additional 4 times the winning amount, and disappear immediately after scraping the remaining number of times</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The God of Wealth\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/image3.png?t=1743425002\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each level, players can invite the God of wealth to their home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different gods of wealth have different effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/image4.png?t=1743425002\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put the God of Wealth into the lottery, you can activate the God of wealth effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are nearly 100 different gods of wealth in the game, with a variety of powerful combinations, so that you get unlimited bonuses double</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Settle accounts\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/image5.png?t=1743425002\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base Bonus x Base Multiplier x Extra multiplier = The bonus you get</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2850460?t=1743425002","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2850460?t=1743425002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/99666a0b074518fe399a22564a41d1af896f9ffc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743425002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/99666a0b074518fe399a22564a41d1af896f9ffc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743425002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300agod and Scratch Card\u300b is a scratch-off simulation roguelite game. You can use dozens of different God of Wealth and winning symbols to form special scratch cards, and then scratch the winning amount to help you win the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Scratch Card<strong>\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai